            <ArticleTitle>Bone lymphoma revealed by cruralgia during pregnancy: a case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>205</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.11604/pamj.2014.18.205.2294</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pregnancy complicated by Non Hodgkin lymphoma (NHL) is rare, about 100 cases have been reported. We will describe the case of a multifocal bone lymphoma revealed by a left hyperalgetic and deficient cruralgia in a female in the second trimester of pregnancy.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
